  "title": "露头裂缝统计：从暗色迹线到方向与裂缝强度",
  "version": "1.0.1",
  "updated": "2026-10-24",
  "tabs": {
    "background": {
      "label": "专业背景",
      "lede": "在限定露头窗口内提取裂缝迹线，说明方向分布、单位面积迹线长度，以及扫描线统计为何依赖位置。",
      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "CONTEXT",
          "title": "裂缝为什么值得在勘察阶段记录",
          "html": "<p>岩石破裂形成裂缝；在二维露头照片上看到的是裂缝面与露头面的交线，称为迹线。开放、连通的裂缝可能形成流体通道，矿物充填的裂缝也可能阻碍流动。因此先记录几何，再结合充填、开度和连通性讨论储层，不能只凭“裂缝多”判断油气富集。</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"露头裂缝迹线与储层渗流\"><rect width=\"700\" height=\"230\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f5f8f7\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#24414a\"><rect x=\"32\" y=\"40\" width=\"270\" height=\"135\" fill=\"#d9ccb1\"/><path d=\"M75 40l45 135M170 40l45 135M32 135l270-65\" stroke=\"#375a61\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M90 85l90 28\" stroke=\"#277fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"45\" y=\"207\">露头平面上只看到裂缝与表面的交线</text><text x=\"347\" y=\"70\">裂缝：岩石的破裂面</text><text x=\"347\" y=\"110\">迹线：破裂面在露头上的交线</text><text x=\"347\" y=\"150\">可能增大连通性，也可能被矿物充填</text><text x=\"347\" y=\"193\">还需了解开度、充填和连通关系</text></g></svg><figcaption>裂缝能影响储层流动路径；这张图解释迹线的含义，不由线条数量直接计算渗透率。</figcaption></figure>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "MEASURE",
          "title": "测量裂缝，必须同时说明观察窗口",
          "html": "<p>本例窗口宽12 m、高8 m，像素标尺为0.1 m。P21使用窗口内部所有提取迹线的长度之和除以96 m²；P10使用水平扫描线与迹线的交点数除以12 m。移动扫描线会改变交点数，窗口整体的P21则不变。迹线方向是相对于照片水平轴的0–180°角，并非已经换算的地理走向。</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"P21 和 P10 的统计分母不同\"><rect width=\"700\" height=\"230\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f5f8f7\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#24414a\"><rect x=\"35\" y=\"35\" width=\"260\" height=\"145\" fill=\"#f2e7d1\" stroke=\"#a5bcb6\"/><path d=\"M70 35l60 145M160 35l60 145M35 140l260-75\" stroke=\"#375a61\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M35 110h260\" stroke=\"#c17833\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 4\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"65\">P21 = 迹线总长度 / 窗口面积</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"105\">单位 m / m² = m⁻¹</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"150\">P10 = 扫描线交点数 / 扫描线长度</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"190\">单位 个 / m；与扫描线方向有关</text></g></svg><figcaption>窗口边界截断的迹线只计窗口内部长度。两种量都要保留实际分母，不能混为“裂缝百分比”。</figcaption></figure>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "METHOD",
          "title": "图像方法怎样找线，怎样知道找错了",
          "html": "<p>灰度阈值选出暗像素，每个像素向多种候选法向角和距离投票；同一直线上的像素会在Hough参数空间聚集。取高票峰并压制相近峰，得到直线候选。演示图由4条贯穿窗口的直线加噪声构成；模型只读取灰度图，参考几何留到评价时进行一对一匹配。短小、弯曲或交叉密集的迹线适合通过原图叠加检查。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "READ_AND_TEST",
          "title": "把P10和P21当作两种不同的取样问题",
          "html": "<p>灰度图上的青色L编号与逐线表一一对应；表内长度只计12m×8m照片窗口内的部分。玫瑰图统计每15°内的迹线条数，画两侧是同一条无向迹线的对称表示，不要把两侧加起来当成两条裂缝。灰度阈值越高，入选暗像素越多；最低票数越高，直线候选要求越严格，二者改变的不是同一件事。</p><p><b>保持提取条件，移动扫描线：</b>运行后点击照片上、中、下位置，比较逐线表与P21是否保持，P10是否随交点数变化。扫描线控件表示从照片上边界向下的距离，单位m。P10=交点数/12m；P21=迹线总长度/96m²。此合成图的四条迹线贯穿窗口，某些扫描线位置交点数可能相同，这也应如实保留。再提高最低票数，定位哪条L候选消失及长度分母是否改变。二维迹线角既不是裂缝面倾角，也不能直接推出渗透率。</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "从观测到可核查结果",
      "lead": [
        "在限定露头窗口内提取裂缝迹线，说明方向分布、单位面积迹线长度，以及扫描线统计为何依赖位置。"
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "选择窗口与暗像素",
          "role": "数据",
          "do": "调节灰度阈值、噪声和裂缝对比度，观察哪些像素进入投票。",
          "effect": "固定比例尺的二维灰度观测和阈值掩膜。",
          "trap": "阴影和层理也会偏暗；暗像素并不自动等于裂缝。"
        },
        {
          "name": "Hough投票提取直线",
          "role": "方法",
          "do": "每5°扫描法向角，按2像素距离分箱；设置最低票数并去除相近重复峰。",
          "effect": "最多8条窗口内直线段和每条票数。",
          "trap": "当前直线模型适合贯穿迹线；不能把结果外推为裂缝面。"
        },
        {
          "name": "统计与对照核查",
          "role": "解释",
          "do": "裁剪到窗口后测长，画15°分箱的方向玫瑰图；移动扫描线计算P10。",
          "effect": "P21、P10、逐线长度及与固定严格基线的F1比较。",
          "trap": "长度受窗口截断；参考匹配容差须与预测一起保留。"
        }
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "title": "步骤图解与统计口径",
        "html": "<figure class=\"case-flow-overview case-flow-compact study-workflow-overview\" data-flow-scene=\"g4\" style=\"margin:18px 0 24px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fafbf9;border:1px solid #e0e6e0;border-radius:8px;min-width:0;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><style>.case-flow-compact h3{font-size:19px!important;line-height:1.6!important;color:#355a50;margin:0 0 5px!important}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-scroll{overflow-x:auto;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;overscroll-behavior-x:contain}.case-flow-compact svg{display:block;width:100%;min-width:940px;height:auto;font-family:system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-title{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;fill:#355a50}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-detail{font-size:14px;fill:#6b8078}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-edge{font-size:13px;fill:#70877d;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#fafbf9;stroke-width:4px}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node polygon{stroke:#b7c8bc;stroke-width:1}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[role=button]{cursor:pointer;outline:none}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[aria-current=true] rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[aria-current=true] polygon,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node:focus rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node:focus polygon{stroke:#347a65;stroke-width:2}.case-flow-compact svg text{pointer-events:none}.case-flow-compact figcaption{font-size:14px!important;line-height:1.7!important;color:#75877b;margin:4px 0 0!important}</style><h3>本例方法概览</h3><div class=\"case-flow-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"流程概览，可横向滚动\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1100 250\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"从露头迹线到裂缝强度\"><defs><marker id=\"cf-g4\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L6 3L0 6Z\" fill=\"#78958b\"/></marker></defs>\n <path d=\"M210 65H230\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-g4)\"/><path d=\"M420 65H440\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-g4)\"/><path d=\"M630 65H670\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-g4)\"/><path d=\"M800 65H880\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-g4)\"/><text x=\"840\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">可继续</text><path d=\"M735 110V140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-g4)\"/><text x=\"775\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">需核查</text><path d=\"M325 95V170H440\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-g4)\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">同一观测</text><path d=\"M860 170H870V120H975V95\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#cf-g4)\"/><text x=\"927\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">确认后</text><path d=\"M975 95V140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-g4)\"/><path d=\"M535 195V222H975V195\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-g4)\"/><text x=\"750\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">同条件对照</text>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"0\" data-flow-node=\"input\" transform=\"translate(20 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eef2ed\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">露头窗口</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">12m乘8m灰度图</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"0\" data-flow-node=\"prepare\" transform=\"translate(230 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">灰度分割</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">阈值筛选暗像素</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"model\" transform=\"translate(440 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">Hough提取</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">角度距离投票去重</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"baseline\" transform=\"translate(440 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f4efe4\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">严格取峰</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">70票且最多2条</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-node=\"gate\" data-flow-step=\"2\"><polygon points=\"735,20 800,65 735,110 670,65\" fill=\"#fbf0d9\"/><text x=\"735\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">先核查阴影与层理再解释裂缝连通性</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"review\" transform=\"translate(670 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f6eade\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">叠加核查</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">逐线位置与方向</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"output\" transform=\"translate(880 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">裂缝统计</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">P21与扫描线P10</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"compare\" transform=\"translate(880 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">几何匹配</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">角度距离容差下F1</text></g>\n </svg></div><figcaption>详细原理、数据图表与计算见下方各步骤。<span data-flow-instruction></span></figcaption></figure><h3>选择窗口与暗像素</h3><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 220\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"灰度阈值决定哪些像素参与投票\"><rect width=\"700\" height=\"220\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f5f8f7\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#24414a\"><rect x=\"35\" y=\"45\" width=\"210\" height=\"115\" fill=\"#b8b8b8\"/><path d=\"M65 45l70 115M35 135l210-55\" stroke=\"#353535\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><path d=\"M275 102h65\" stroke=\"#568379\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"370\" y=\"45\" width=\"210\" height=\"115\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#b2c9c1\"/><path d=\"M400 45l70 115M370 135l210-55\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"35\" y=\"202\">原灰度图</text><text x=\"370\" y=\"202\">灰度小于阈值 → 暗像素掩膜</text></g></svg><figcaption>提高阈值会纳入更多暗点；灰度差异过小时，噪声与裂缝可能混在一起。</figcaption></figure><h3>Hough投票提取直线</h3><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 220\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"像素共线在参数空间形成投票峰\"><rect width=\"700\" height=\"220\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f5f8f7\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#24414a\"><path d=\"M70 170V30m0 140h540\" stroke=\"#9bb9af\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"15\" y=\"25\">票数</text><text x=\"492\" y=\"204\">候选直线参数</text><path d=\"M90 164L130 154L160 158L185 45L210 160L280 150L320 75L350 164L395 100L420 163L470 55L500 165L570 157\" stroke=\"#2c7a6a\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M70 125h540\" stroke=\"#be8035\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><text x=\"490\" y=\"116\">最低票数</text></g></svg><figcaption>这是投票峰原理示意；本次提取的真实票数在逐线表显示。过低阈值会带入弱假峰，过高会漏线。</figcaption></figure><h3>统计与对照核查</h3><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 220\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"面积统计和扫描线统计各保留分母\"><rect width=\"700\" height=\"220\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f5f8f7\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#24414a\"><text x=\"35\" y=\"58\">窗口内迹线总长 ÷ 96 m²</text><path d=\"M35 78h300\" stroke=\"#2d7b6e\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"35\" y=\"112\">P21：同一组迹线的面积强度</text><text x=\"365\" y=\"58\">扫描线交点数 ÷ 12 m</text><path d=\"M365 78h300\" stroke=\"#bf8136\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"365\" y=\"112\">P10：这条扫描线的交切频率</text><text x=\"35\" y=\"177\">移动扫描线：P10可能改变，P21保持不变</text></g></svg><figcaption>分别查看方向分箱与交点数。提取错误会传入几何统计，应该先核查叠加图再解释。</figcaption></figure>"
      },
